{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16448","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第九拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第九拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当日苏武单于问，道是宾鸿解传信。\n学他刺血写得书，书上千重万重恨。\n髯胡少年能走马，弯弓射飞无远近。\n遂令边雁转怕人，绝域何由达方寸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}